# TUSKWIND: proof that the better ending can be reached. The demo player
# again plays with button presses only, but now goes out of its way for
# shells, chests and keys, spends nothing at the stalls, keeps its terns
# for the hall (three shells each) and climbs the shaft, and meets the old
# one with 50 or more shells, on three different generated maps: the
# long talk, and the alien.
game tuskwind
wait 20
cheat seed 1
botuntil state == 2 400
cheat collect
botuntil state == 4 36000
expect cherry_end == 1
expect goals & 4
expect goals & 2
expect goals & 1
botuntil state == 0 4000
expect save_cherries == 1
cheat seed 3
botuntil state == 2 400
botuntil state == 4 36000
expect cherry_end == 1
botuntil state == 0 4000
cheat seed 12
botuntil state == 2 400
botuntil state == 4 36000
expect cherry_end == 1
expect shells >= 50
botuntil state == 0 4000
expect save_cherries == 3
expect save_chests >= 1
